[1;36m==>[0m 8. propagation — composed, attenuated and sampled, all three, so attenuation is falsifiable
  a composed influence is scaled by the factor at its depth; past depth 4 it carries a direction and **no magnitude** — the path is still named, graded and dated, because a direction a reader cannot locate in the graph is not a direction
    brand-goodwill           depth 3  composed 0.001/0.034/0.288  x0.6  -> 0.001/0.020/0.173  sampled p50 0.023
    dvd-by-mail              depth 2  composed 0.020/0.113/0.320  x0.8  -> 0.016/0.090/0.256  sampled p50 0.089
    streaming-experience     depth 1  composed 0.100/0.250/0.400  x1.0  -> 0.100/0.250/0.400  sampled p50 0.246
    joint brand-goodwill           0.0251 against 0.0251 if independent; shares nothing
    joint dvd-by-mail              0.0933 against 0.0933 if independent; shares nothing
    joint streaming-experience     0.2500 against 0.2500 if independent; shares nothing
  structural edges do not propagate, and paths are combined by noisy-OR rather than summed
  a shared edge is drawn once per trial, so a common cause is not counted twice — every
  component here is reached by one path, so there is nothing to combine and the two figures
  agree trivially. The diamond that exercises the discount is in the pocket org, step 13
[1;36m==>[0m 8b. doing versus learning — an intervention does not rewrite its own causes
  do(streaming-experience): severs cdn-capacity-lifts-streaming, updates nothing upstream
  observe(streaming-experience): severs nothing, updates belief about content-delivery-network — and carries no magnitude there
  the downstream halves are byte-identical: the difference lives above the composition
